## Why This Is Asked

Tests real-world composition of runtime modules, per-tenant isolation, and advanced hooks patterns.

## Key Concepts

- React.lazy and Suspense for on-demand modules
- useSyncExternalStore to subscribe to external per-tenant data
- Memoized selectors keyed by tenantId/moduleId
- Runtime Module Registry pattern
- Safe unmount and cleanup on tenant switches

## Code Example

